 him who is most resolved to win it.\"\n\nFistborn is a PvP-oriented game where players are capable of training to become stronger. Choose a style to master, or learn various skills to your liking and show off your fighting prowess.\n\nMake sure to like and favorite the game to show some support!\n\nThe controls and game information can be found in the Guide tab at the very start.\nKeybinds can be changed as you prefer in the settings menu under controls.\n\nPC Controls:\nE - Interact\nW + W - Run\nQ - Dash\nR - Combat/Fists\nM1 - Light Punch\nM2 - Heavy Punch\nF - Block & Dodge\nB - Carry \nV - Mount/Grip\nT - Mode\nP - Map Markers (Locations)\n\nController Controls:\nL1+R1 - Inventory\nR1+R2 - Mode\nL2 - Block\nL3 - Run\nR2 - M1\nY - M2\nB - Dash\nA - Jump\nX - Carry\nL1+X - 1\nL1+Y - 2\nL1+B - 3\nR1+X - 4\nR1+Y - 5\nR1+B - 6\nDPadUp - Mount/Grip\nDPadDown - Menu\nDPadLeft - Shift Lock\nDPadRight - Combat","path":"/game/106051943710043-fistborn","slug":"106051943710043-fistborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/84038fa06c8a3ef44cfac3831655dcadb43c9bac22aeb852b285109db511015d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3a09b799d9a0616dc0a2ef6507a1f978/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":15253062,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-16T12:43:00.574Z","creator":{"name":"Kengan","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":2}}],"totalGames":14174,"totalPages":591,"currentPage":396}